Package: GeneSelectR2
Type: Package
Title: Predictive Gene Selection and Biological Interpretation
Version: 0.99.4
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Damir", family = "Zhakparov",
           email = "dzhakparov@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7175-0843"))
Description: Provides a transcriptomics workflow for predictive gene ranking,
    repeated-selection information and biological interpretation. Elastic-net
    models are fitted across repeated stratified folds. Recurrence and
    excluded-sample contribution are compared with shuffled-outcome references
    and combined into a gene ranking. Gene Ontology, Hallmark gene sets, Open
    Targets disease associations and STRING interactions support downstream
    interpretation in binary-outcome studies.
